# Owners of the paths that can see or influence the release signing key.
#
# Review is only enforced when the `protect-main` ruleset (or a classic branch
# protection rule on `main`) enables "Require review from Code Owners". Without
# that toggle this file is just a label.
#
# Every path below can end up running with `ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64`,
# `ANDROID_STORE_PASSWORD`, `ANDROID_KEY_ALIAS` and `ANDROID_KEY_PASSWORD` in its
# environment, so a change here must never be merged unreviewed.

# The CI itself.
/.github/               @Idea-atmosphere
/.github/workflows/     @Idea-atmosphere
/.github/scripts/       @Idea-atmosphere

# Gradle wiring that reads the keystore and the signing passwords.
/android/app/build.gradle       @Idea-atmosphere
/android/app/build.gradle.kts   @Idea-atmosphere
/android/gradle.properties      @Idea-atmosphere
/android/settings.gradle        @Idea-atmosphere
/android/settings.gradle.kts    @Idea-atmosphere
/android/build.gradle           @Idea-atmosphere
/android/build.gradle.kts       @Idea-atmosphere
